#: sunflower/operation.py:471
msgid "There was a problem moving specified path. What would you like to do?"
msgstr "Wystąpił problem podczas przenoszenia do pliku. Co chcesz zrobić?"

#: sunflower/operation.py:510
msgid ""
"There was a problem renaming specified path. What would you like to do?"
